{"id":"d49d958f-8a03-44e0-961f-aa4694e5ebc3","object":"chat.completion","created":1795147299,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"SELECT COUNT(*) AS review_count\nFROM order_reviews\nWHERE TRIM(review_comment_title) <> '';","reasoning_content":"Count reviews where title trimmed is not empty. Use TRIM. Count records. Single aggregate, no LIMIT needed.\n\nShould empty string after trim be excluded. Also NULL? \"标题去首尾空格后为空的不算\" - trim(title) <> ''. NULL yields NULL, excluded too. That seems fine.\n\nCount of review records: COUNT(*) rows in order_reviews. The business identity is review record; primary key (review_id, order_id) combination. Use COUNT(*) since each row is a review. Actually order_reviews may have duplicate review_id across orders, but each row is a review record. COUNT(*) is fine."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2516,"completion_tokens":154,"total_tokens":2670,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":2304},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":129},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":2304,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":212},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}